        "original_id": "34cc23ef-3b30-5f19-89fe-92b9e04f1799",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Electoral district of Goulburn, Adelaide, New South Wales\n- People: Pru Goward, Augustus James\n- Organizations: Liberal Party of Australia, New South Wales Legislative Assembly, Berejiklian government\n- Roles: Member for Goulburn, Minister for Family and Community Services, Minister for Social Housing, Minister for Prevention of Domestic Violence and Sexual Assault\n\nFacts:\n- Augustus James was the Liberal/Nationalist member for Goulburn in the New South Wales Legislative Assembly from 1907 to 1920.\n- Augustus James served as a minister from 1916 to 1920.\n- Pru Goward was born on 2 September 1952 in Adelaide.\n- Pru Goward has served as the Minister for Prevention of Domestic Violence and Sexual Assault in New South Wales since 2015.\n- Pru Goward has served as the New South Wales Minister for Family and Community Services and Minister for Social Housing since January 2017 in the Berejiklian government.\n- The electoral district of Goulburn is represented by Pru Goward of the Liberal Party of Australia.",
